  "body": "Whether you're looking for a comfortable family home, a lock-up-and-leave option, or a smart investment, this brand new property offers an excellent opportunity to secure your place in one of the Hibiscus Coast's popular coastal communities.\r\n\r\nStep inside and you'll immediately appreciate the welcoming layout, generous natural light and easy-care design. The home features three spacious double bedrooms, including a well-appointed master bedroom with its own ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, plus a stylish family bathroom for added convenience.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is the designer kitchen, offering plenty of bench space and practical storage for everyday cooking and entertaining. The open-plan kitchen, dining and living area creates a wonderful central space for family life, with excellent indoor-outdoor flow extending to the fully fenced backyard. Private and secure. It is ideal for children to play and provides an easy-care outdoor space for enjoying time with family and friends. With low-maintenance grounds and a practical layout, this is a home designed to make everyday living easy.\r\n\r\nYou'll love the lifestyle that comes with living in Gulf Harbour, surrounded by beautiful coastal scenery and a fantastic range of recreational opportunities. Enjoy easy access to nearby beaches, golf, walking tracks and waterfront attractions, while local amenities are also within convenient reach. For those commuting to Auckland City, the Gulf Harbour ferry provides another transport option, making the journey to the city convenient and enjoyable while avoiding the stress of driving.\r\n\r\nThis is an awesome opportunity to acquire a well-appointed home in the heart of Gulf Harbour. Act quickly and make it yours today.\r\n\r\nAll agents are welcome.",
